==Battleground==
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s (800%) spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*2 [[Samurai Doggy|Samurai Doggies]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge Dark]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**8 [[Doge Dark]]s (800%) spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**2 [[Lucky Dags]] spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**1 [[Gory Groom]] spawns.
**1 [[Selena]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Yet again, similar to Heavenly Tower's [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 13|Floor 13]], but without [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s, higher magnifications, and the addition of Lucky Dags and Selena. [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|Anti Darks]] like [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] are useful here, just make sure they don't get hit by Lucky Dags, they have an insanely high attack power of 120,000 per hit! Other than that, this is mostly your run-of-the-mill [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemy stage.

